{'query': 'cheap vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredient costs in India', 'results': [{'title': 'What Saved Dinner (And My Budget)? These 29 Indian Recipes', 'url': 'https://easyindiancookbook.com/what-saved-dinner-and-my-budget-these-29-indian-recipes/', 'snippet': 'May 25, 2025 · Dinner was almost a problem, and money was tight. Then, these 29 Indian recipes made everything better. Each dish used simple ingredients and did not cost much. The flavors were rich, and the cooking was easy to follow. With these recipes, food tasted great, and spending stayed low. Instant Pot Vegetable Korma. Photo credit: Easy Indian Cookbook.'}, {'title': '27 Quick and Easy Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes', 'url': 'https://veggiekitchenly.com/quick-and-easy-dinner-recipes-vegetarian-indian/', 'snippet': 'Jun 30, 2026 · Here you will find 27 Quick and Easy Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes you can actually make. They cover a range of moods—from bright tomato curries to creamy dal and stir-fried veggies. Most come together in 30 minutes or less. Many use one pan or a single pot, which means less cleanup.'}, {'title': '57 Easy Vegetarian Indian Recipes (Dinner included!)Indian Dinner Recipes | 900+ Veg Dinner Ideas - Tarla Dalal40+ Best Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes (Easy Dinner Ideas)20 Best Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes - anastasiablogger.com10 Easy Indian Vegetarian Dinner Ideas for Busy Weeknights', 'url': 'https://hurrythefoodup.com/vegetarian-indian-recipes/', 'snippet': 'With our take on traditional, authentic Indian dishes, you can scroll through a variety of easy-to-make, (including low-calorie) veggie recipes of India. From spicy veggie curry recipes to colourful Indian-styled side dishes, you can create a vegetarian Indian feast in no time! We regularly update our list with new Indian vegetarian recipes that we... See full list on hurrythefoodup.com With main dishes, breakfast, lunches, dinners, sides and desserts, from classic Indian curry to awesome chutneys and delicious afters, there’s plenty to choose from. See full list on hurrythefoodup.com Bonus:fast, spicy, delicious and so good! There are roast potatoes and then, there’s OUR version. Spud lover or no, we guarantee you our Indian – Irish fusion curried potatoes will have you coming back for seconds. Or, possibly thirds too. Crispy, spicy outside, soft & fluffy on the inside, these are a massive upgrade to the usual Bombay potatoes a... See full list on hurrythefoodup.com Bonus:very tasty, quick and spicy breakfast India loves its savory breakfast and Indian cuisine has many, many delicious recipes. These chickpea flour pancakes, or besan cheelas, are a fabulous way to get your day going. Packed with vegetables, these cheelas are amazing served with pickles and green chutney. If you are newly vegan or pure vegetaria... See full list on hurrythefoodup.com Ready in: 30 minutes Recipe by: ProfusionCurry Bonus:crispy, delicious, healthy, perfect for lunch box Tea-time snack, dinner party appetiser or light lunch with lassi, aloo tikki is a definite crowd pleaser. Crispy and crunchy on the outside, fluffy on the inside, it is easy to see why Aloo Tikki is such a popular Indian street food. Make this in ... See full list on hurrythefoodup.com Recipe by: TheCurryMommy Bonus:tasty, high protein and healthy dessert Call it sheera, sheero, kesari or sooji halwa, this dessert enjoys a special status amongst Indian dessert dishes. Semolina roasted in ghee and cooked in sugar and milk makes for such a party in your mouth. Spice it up with some saffron for that special touch. Ready in: 50 minut... See full list on hurrythefoodup.com This post might have left you with a question or two, so let’s clarify two that popped into my head when compiling the list above! See full list on hurrythefoodup.com Feb 6, 2026 · Easy Indian Dinner Vegetarian Recipes are perfect for anyone who wants to cook quick meals, enjoy authentic flavors, and use simple ingredients at home. These recipes include a variety of vegetarian dishes, one-pot meals, and healthy options that save both time and effort. Jan 20, 2023 · Here is a roundup of 40+ easy Indian dinner recipes, including curries, lentils, and rice dishes that you can try. A lot of recipes use a pressure cooker, which is easy and takes very little time to prepare. You can also make them on the stovetop. Aug 8, 2025 · If you’ve been searching for an easy recipe collection packed with flavor and variety, this roundup of Indian style vegetarian dinners will become your go-to guide. Whether you’re juggling work, family, or just want something delicious without spending hours in the kitchen, these 10 easy Indian vegetarian dinner recipes are here to save your evening.'}, {'title': 'Indian Dinner Recipes | 900+ Veg Dinner Ideas - Tarla Dalal', 'url': 'https://www.tarladalal.com/recipes-for-indian-dinner-939', 'snippet': 'Feb 6, 2026 · Easy Indian Dinner Vegetarian Recipes are perfect for anyone who wants to cook quick meals, enjoy authentic flavors, and use simple ingredients at home. These recipes include a variety of vegetarian dishes, one-pot meals, and healthy options that save both time and effort.'}, {'title': '40+ Best Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes (Easy Dinner Ideas)20 Best Vegetarian Indian Dinner Recipes - anastasiablogger.com10 Easy Indian Vegetarian Dinner Ideas for Busy Weeknights', 'url': 'https://www.indianveggiedelight.com/indian-dinner-recipes/', 'snippet': 'Jan 20, 2023 · Here is a roundup of 40+ easy Indian dinner recipes, including curries, lentils, and rice dishes that you can try. A lot of recipes use a pressure cooker, which is easy and takes very little time to prepare. You can also make them on the stovetop. Aug 8, 2025 · If you’ve been searching for an easy recipe collection packed with flavor and variety, this roundup of Indian style vegetarian dinners will become your go-to guide. Whether you’re juggling work, family, or just want something delicious without spending hours in the kitchen, these 10 easy Indian vegetarian dinner recipes are here to save your evening.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.7651789999799803}
